      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Prerequisites</strong> Juggernaut Warforged heritage</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You manually control and recompose the components of your body, healing and repairing your wounds. You gain fast healing equal to half your level for 1 minute.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Enhancement</strong> While your Juggernaut Repair is active, you gain a +1 status bonus to your AC.</p>"
